# The /admin pages gate themselves in PHP via auth(2) (requires users.is_admin=1)
# — see template/top.php. The old HTTP Basic auth here pointed at a .htpasswd on
# the legacy webroot path (/var/www/untrobotics/...), which doesn't exist in the
# container, so Apache 500'd before the page could run. Removed it; just keep
# directory listing off.
Options -Indexes
